# ============================================================
# WALLACE CORP — EDGE DEFENSE GRID
# Cloudflare Pages response headers (camgarrison.com)
#
# CSP notes:
#   - script-src: self + a sha256 hash of the single inline
#     theme-bootstrap script (identical on every page). If you
#     ever edit that inline script, recompute the hash:
#       node -e "const c=require('crypto'),f=require('fs');
#       const m=f.readFileSync('index.html','utf8')
#         .match(/<script>([\s\S]*?)<\/script>/);
#       console.log(c.createHash('sha256').update(m[1]).digest('base64'))"
#   - three.js is self-hosted at /js/three.min.js (lazy-loaded by
#     main.js on the archive page), so no CDN appears in
#     script-src at all.
#   - Cloudflare Web Analytics is NOT allowed while its beacon is
#     commented out. When activating it, add
#     https://static.cloudflareinsights.com to script-src and
#     https://cloudflareinsights.com to connect-src.
#   - object-src/base-uri 'none': no plugins, no <base> hijack.
#   - style-src-attr 'unsafe-inline' covers inline style attributes,
#     while style-src-elem 'self' means no injected <style> block or
#     foreign stylesheet can ever apply. The plain style-src is only
#     the fallback for browsers that predate the split directives.
#   - fonts are self-hosted in /fonts, so font-src is 'self' and
#     no Google Fonts origins appear anywhere in the policy.
#   - frame-src/frame-ancestors 'self' so the builds page can
#     embed its own PDFs and nothing else can frame the site.
#   - connect-src allows ipwho.is (IP -> city/coords, no
#     permission prompt) + api.open-meteo.com (current weather):
#     together they drive the live local-weather rain canvas.
#   - accelerometer/gyroscope are (self) so deviceorientation
#     can drive the mobile tilt parallax.
#   - "! Access-Control-Allow-Origin" detaches the wildcard CORS
#     header Pages adds to every asset. Nothing here is meant to be
#     read cross-origin, and CORP is already same-origin.
#   - HSTS: this file asks for a one year preload policy, but a
#     zone level HSTS setting in the Cloudflare dashboard overrides
#     it. If the live header says max-age=0, fix it under
#     SSL/TLS > Edge Certificates > HSTS.
#   - style.css and main.js are referenced with ?v=YYYYMMDD in the
#     HTML. Bump that stamp whenever either file changes, because
#     the zone browser cache TTL holds them for hours.
# ============================================================

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-dWhgjKjXuieQkYS21MT+1auL8MtFopjPKbeIdY9ik3c='; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src-elem 'self'; style-src-attr 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.open-meteo.com https://ipwho.is; frame-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(self), gyroscope=(self), magnetometer=(), camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), display-capture=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), hid=(), bluetooth=(), midi=(), idle-detection=(), screen-wake-lock=(), publickey-credentials-get=(), xr-spatial-tracking=(), browsing-topics=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  Origin-Agent-Cluster: ?1
  X-DNS-Prefetch-Control: off
  X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies: none
  ! Access-Control-Allow-Origin

# Long-cache the vendored library (bump the filename if upgraded)
/js/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Self-hosted fonts never change in place
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/imgs/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=604800

/docs/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400
